    "content": "Kinetic’s XRP-linked lending market recently reported a 0.04% base rate prior to rewards, according to snapshot data. The platform's figures highlight modest loan demand for FXRP compared to its overall collateral use and incentive-supported returns. Further details on these lending dynamics and returns were highlighted in recent market updates.",
